<title>UK: GrandMet, Guinness rise on Goldman upgrade.</title>
<headline>GrandMet, Guinness rise on Goldman upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Grand Metropolitan Plc and Guinness Plc rose on Tuesday after Goldman Sachs added the two companies to its &quot;recommended&quot; list.</p>
<p>By 1115 GMT Grand Met was up 9-1/2p at 575p while Guinness was up 2-1/2p at 582-1/2. Goldman set a target of 662p on both stocks, which are in the process of merging.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
